      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T06:21:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Happy to upload a similar change to the SUBMITTING_PATCHES file also, referring to this AI policy.\n\nWe could also just have a separate AI_POLICY standalone file referenced from both of them.",
      "parentUuid": "fe53b063_4f973178",
