      "message": "\u003e Happy to upload a similar change to the SUBMITTING_PATCHES file also, referring to this AI policy.\n\nThat seems fine. I\u0027d be happy to see an update to `SUBMITTING_PATCHES` in this change so it\u0027s all done at once.",
