      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T23:42:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this heading is misleading, as it\u0027s using \"author\" in a legal sense. We\u0027re not requiring that a human types the contribution into an editor and that\u0027s what \"author\" is likely to be assumed to mean at a glance. I think broader wording for the heading and specifics in the body will work better here:\n```suggestion\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d Contribution Attribution\n```",
