      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T23:42:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I saw there was discussion that we don\u0027t want to require `Assisted-By:` footers. Do we want to discourage them here?\n\n```suggestion\nsubmitting the change is the sole recognized responsible author of the code.\n\nWe prefer omitting `Assisted-By:` footers crediting AI or other tools as\nthere isn\u0027t clear value from including such a footer.\n```",
      "revId": "1ade253d3c4f72a64679b24c7c54c89280d54b3d",
